Z||000006||pherder||06-26-2001||05:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ThatRickGuy:<BR><B>I'm in the same boat. I'm moving back to WI in about 15 days, I sent the cash in for their hitch kit about 3 weeks ago and haven't heard anything yet. if I don't get that hitch, I'm gonna be hard pressed to move.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR><B>AND</B> it still will not work!  I know, I got one of those "hitches"  It was ~2" too narrow to line up with the one frame hole that is used to bolt the hitch to (the other has to be drilled).<P>I remember at least 3~4 of us who got these hitches that will NOT fit as supplied.  <P>I bent the side arms out to make it come close to the required width but I am not sure I want to use it like that.<P>One member paid to ship his back and when he finally got it returned, it still wouldn't fit!!  He turned around and put it on eBay and lost about $100 after counting up the costs.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Just say <B>NO</B> to OUTLAW PERFORMANCE.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul<BR>||||reg||1
